STAMPEDE prototype: parallel MALA over parallel twisted-Gumbel PF.

Setup
-----
PF (inner): T=1024, N=32, K_W=64, windowed Gumbel-STE resampling.
Twist:      precomputed ONCE at PHI_ANCHOR=0 via PARALLEL BIF
            (closed-form stationary Riccati J* + associative-scan
            affine recurrence for h). Matches the serial BIF to 0.0
            absolute error.
MALA outer: windowed (run_parallel_mala_window), K_BLOCK=50,
            autodiff_mode='forward', MALA_MAX_ITER=1000.
PHI_TRUE=0.9. Prior: tanh(theta) ~ Uniform(-1,1).

